 minutes_per_appearance,player,playerMetrics.minutesPerAppearance.label,Ø Minutes per appearance,"Average minutes played per appearance (minutes / appearances, where an appearance is a match the player actually played). A squad-list playing-time read describing role - a regular starter versus a rotation or impact-sub player - not quality. The mart computes the value inline via safe_divide; this row registers its meaning.",int_legs__player_match,sum(minutes_played),countif(minutes_played > 0),expression,false,decimal_0,playing_time,2,neutral,"Average minutes per appearance; high = a full-90 regular, low = a rotation or impact-sub role. A playing-time role read, not good or bad."
